# DailyBeat — local Mac agent context

## Repo
- Offline IPS police diary Android app (Jetpack Compose, Room, MediaPipe LLM, whisper.cpp planned)
- Active branch: `cursor/android-skeleton-cc46`
- GitHub: https://github.com/sampathmannam/dailybeat

## Run on Mac emulator (NOT cloud VM)
```bash
./scripts/mac_sync_and_run.sh
./scripts/mac_emulator_demo.sh
```

## Build
```bash
cd android && ./gradlew assembleDebug
```

## Emulator testing
- User has Android emulator on MacBook — use local `adb`, not cloud emulator
- Grant permissions via `adb shell pm grant com.dailybeat.app ...`
- Voice FAB uses demo transcript on emulator when Whisper model absent

## Push workflow
- Commit on feature branch, push to `origin cursor/android-skeleton-cc46`
- User pulls on Mac before testing
